<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IBCA reaffirms Syfrets domestic ratings.</title>
<headline>IBCA reaffirms Syfrets domestic ratings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit rating agency IBCA said on Monday it had reaffirmed the domestic ratings of both Syfrets Bank Ltd and its holding company Syfrets Ltd at A2 short-term and A- long-term.</p>
<p>Syfrets had perfomed well in a difficult year in which interest margins and asset quality were under pressure, underlining the group's stable revenues with a sizeable proportion coming from asset management, IBCA said.</p>
<p>Syfrets is a unit of Nedcor Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
